Dear Stephan,

I am applying for the SAP HANA AI Build Developer position. The role is listed at T2/T3, but I would like to make the case for joining at T1.

Developer tooling is where I do my best work. In my fifth SAP rotation I built a VS Code extension for domain-based navigation in large CAP projects using TypeScript and the Language Server Protocol -- the kind of work where you feel the impact because developers use it every day.

Agentic AI is the other side of this role that genuinely excites me. I built an AI chat moderation system for a Twitch moderator friend: a multi-task XLM-RoBERTa classifier as a fast pre-filter, combined with an LLM-as-a-Judge layer for edge cases. It is currently in fine-tuning and will go into active use soon. Applying this kind of thinking to a build system at the scale of HANA is a challenge I would find very motivating.

I finish my dual studies at DHBW Mannheim in September 2026 and hold an unconditional hire recommendation from SAP. I would be glad to talk through the details.

#v(2em)

Best regards,

#v(0.5em)

*Max Meinel*
